BT /F1 12 Tf 14 TL 72 740 Td (Sample paper generated by this app for testing. Not a real published article.) Tj T* () Tj T* (5. Discussion) Tj T* (Peer tutoring appears to work mainly by helping students plan their week.) Tj T* (Tutors shared reading schedules and short summaries of hard chapters.) Tj T* () Tj T* (Challenges reported by the universities) Tj T* (The three universities found it hard to recruit enough tutors in the second) Tj T* (half of the semester, and two of them had no quiet rooms for group meetings.) Tj T* () Tj T* (6. Conclusion) Tj T* (A low-cost weekly peer-tutoring program can increase the time first-year) Tj T* (students spend reading course materials, especially for commuting students.) Tj T* () Tj T* (Page 4) Tj T* ET
endstream
